    "title": "Banfield Pet Hospital",
    "description": "Banfield Pet Hospital provides secure, access to your pet\u2019s petcare history and appointment information with Banfield so you can:\r\n\r\n-\tSchedule, view, and manage pet appointments. \r\n-\tAdd new pets to your account.\r\n-\tGet alerts about due or overdue appointments, vaccinations, and medications for your pet(s).\r\n-\tView and download your pet\u2019s veterinary records \u2014 including care history, vaccinations, medications, lab tests, visit summaries, and invoices. \r\n-\tAttend virtual visits with a veterinary professional.\r\n-\tUse Pet Chat\u2122 to get advice from a veterinary professional 24x7.\r\n-\tAccess the Banfield Pet Hospital online pharmacy.",
